  "body": [
    "Our mission is to use our wealth of technical and consulting expertise to deliver tailored and pragmatic solutions, building meaningful and long-term relationships with our clients, adapting to the industry’s ever-changing needs.",
    "We help to address the implications of risk, finance & compliance related challenges. We focus on improving business insight and reducing costs, with experience in programme and transformation delivery.",
    "We support our clients across the model lifecycle, from development to measurement and validation. Our teams specialise in relevant model types – including risk, capital, liquidity, pricing, and stress testing models.",
    "We help our clients to design, develop and implement innovative and efficient technology enabled solutions in areas of data management and governance, process automation and regulatory reporting.",
    "We support our clients in managing their regulatory relationships and in obtaining regulatory permissions and authorisations. We help them navigate the complex regulatory landscape to achieve optimal outcomes.",
    "Reply supports organisations in critical sectors to align with new legal obligations while ensuring high-quality datasets and effective human oversight for all AI initiatives",
    "In the digital age, financial sectors confront escalating cyber risks. Reply presents a strategic approach for DORA compliance, shedding light on the EU's Digital Operational Resilience Act.",
    "Adopting stronger internal control practices while improving business efficiency.",
    "Flexible and easy to use, it provides financial institutions with a toolkit which allows them to easily perform internal stress tests and integrate outcomes into decision-making processes.",
    "Wind-Down Planning remains high on the agenda of the Financial Conduct Authority (FCA).",
    "Climate change is a growing threat to the entire financial system and is already considered as a source of financial risk and then as risk drivers of traditional risk categories.",
    "The birth of a general and structured regulation framing environmental performance of financial institutions creates a series of governance and practical questions within the industry.",
    "Discover how Iveco Group has made Responsible AI a guiding principle of its projects by adopting a governance and risk management model in line with European regulatory requirements.",
    "Reply will join The National AI in Government 2026 to explore responsible AI, automation and workplace transformation across the public sector.",
    "Ransomware is evolving. Are your recovery plans keeping up? Join industry leaders for a strategic breakfast on attacks and resilience.",
    "Reply will be taking part in this year’s premier technology-event hosted by DLA Piper, themed Reimagine, Reinvent, Revolutionise, on Thursday 6 November 2025 in Amsterdam at the historic Beurs van Berlage.",
    "Understanding Compliance and Technical Mandates Workshop: Mastering the EU AI Act with Expert Insights, Demos, and Collaborative Case Studies.",
    "Avantage Reply is sponsoring RiskMinds, which takes place from 13th-16th November 2023. The event brings together 850+ senior risk professionals from banks, buy-side, regulators, academics, fintechs and industry experts.",
    "Climate change will continue for many decades to come, Banks should adequately incorporate climate-related and environmental risk within their governance and risk management frameworks in order to mitigate risks.",
    "Glue Reply has unveiled their new service based on compliance testing and a user-centric approach for an effective implementation of the Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) Consumer Duty, an important aspect of the regulatory framework that governs financial services in the UK.",
    "We are hiring",
    "Discover also"
  ],
